        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "![dspiration rules back|323x500](upload://AdrvfZbUD3dwOXhURl9WaPRF7UW.jpeg)\n\nhere is the advertisement for the next expansion from the back of the Dispiration rulebook.\nChristopher and Adam have said that the plans have changed so we will not be getting this right away. But we should get everything one day\n\nMale hero Naturalist\nFemale hero only 3 clawed fingers, no cape not Young Legacy, no bone spurs not Skyscraper\n\nvillains left to right \nBusy Body's combat tentacles\nspindly clawer hand ? \nProletariat with Hammer\nGun ? Greezer?\nClawed hand ? does this hand belong to the gunner?\nFist ? Vengeful Blade sleaves seem too lose and flowy \nEnergized hand ?",
